{"id":"darom","lemma":"даром","pos":"adv","rank":2989,"glosses":["gratis, for free, for nothing","in vain"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4b/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я получил это даром.","en":"I got it for free.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to receive, to get","l":"получить"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Я получила билет даром.","en":"I got the ticket for nothing.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to receive, to get","l":"получить"},{"g":"ticket"},null]},{"text":"Мы даром времени не теряли.","en":"We weren't wasting our time.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"time","l":"время"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to lose, to waste","l":"терять"}]},{"text":"Я вам его даром отдам.","en":"I'll give it to you for free.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"to give back","l":"отдать"}]},{"text":"Мы отдаём это даром.","en":"We're giving this away for free.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to give back","l":"отдавать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]}]}